    "summary": "Evaluate $\\log_5\\dfrac{(125)(625)}{25}$.",
    "summaryZh": "求 $\\log_5\\dfrac{(125)(625)}{25}$ 的值。",
    "answer": "D. $5$.",
    "answerZh": "D。$5$。",
    "methods": [
      {
        "title": "Express the argument as a power",
        "titleZh": "统一写成同底数幂",
        "steps": [
          "The factors $125$, $625$ and $25$ are respectively $5^3$, $5^4$ and $5^2$. The quotient inside the logarithm is $5^{3+4-2}=5^5$, whose base-five logarithm is $5$."
        ],
        "stepsZh": [
          "$125,625,25$ 分别等于 $5^3,5^4,5^2$。真数化为 $5^{3+4-2}=5^5$，取以 $5$ 为底的对数即得 $5$。"
        ],
